1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,289
Gastrulation turns the one layered blastula into a gastrula with three germ layers.

2
00:00:06,289 --> 00:00:07,708
Nothing new is made.

3
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:10,403
Cells simply move to where they will be needed.

4
00:00:10,403 --> 00:00:14,231
It begins with a groove just below the grey crescent.

5
00:00:14,231 --> 00:00:19,531
Its upper edge, the white dot, is the dorsal lip of the blastopore.

